codex
The failure is reproducible and specific to this sandbox’s PID view: `/proc/self/exe` resolves, while `/proc/<getpid>/exe` does not, and Lean 4.22’s runtime uses the latter to locate itself. I’m adding a narrowly scoped audit-only `LD_PRELOAD` shim under `/tmp/audit-work` that rewrites only `/proc/<digits>/exe` reads to `/proc/self/exe`; this leaves the pinned Lean binaries and generated project unchanged. I’ll record the shim source and verify its scope before rerunning the preflight.
