+    result = check_generation(
+  File "/reference/tools/klean_preflight.py", line 582, in check_generation
+    raise KleanPreflightError(
+tools.klean_preflight.KleanPreflightError: lake clean failed (1): error: could not detect the configuration of the Lake installation
+
+EXIT CODE
+1
+
+DIAGNOSIS
+`readlink /proc/self/exe` succeeds in the audit sandbox, but Lean 4.22's
+runtime constructs `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, which is absent in this sandbox's
+PID view.  The preserved shim rewrites only that exact numeric proc path to
+`/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter the pinned toolchain or generated project.
